      "value": "What is the [animator tracking control](https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/state-behaviors/#animator-tracking-control) state for eyes & eyelids when this occurs? For your reference, if its animator tracking control state is \"Tracking\" the eye movement and blinking will be simulated regardless.\n\nCan you provide an affected avatar ID, or a reproduction video with Local Avatar page shown from the debug UI?",
