      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} I havent had to used the Animator Tracking Control ever and the blinking has not been an issue before.\n\nAlso 9 of 10 avi's i try in an avi search world has the same issue.\n\nAnd for all the avatars i try that has the issue, the \"Eye & Eyelid\" trackign control is st to \"Tracking\" when emoting/doing expressions.\n\nI don't know if its always been reporting \"tracking\" on my own avis since i havent had any issues to check, but at least now its reporting \"tracking\"",
